# Additional MIME types in existing contexts. This file is in the public domain.
#
# Entries are appended after the historical UNKNOWN identifier in each context.
# Keep existing entries in order and append new ones to preserve numeric IDs.
# The legacy mime.types and mime_cad.types registries retain their established
# order; new codecs should be registered here rather than inserted there.
#
# MIME type (lowercased)                         Extensions
image/exr                                       exr
